      "writtenOn": "2024-05-08T07:20:05Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "+1, CTS shouldn\u0027t get resigned, so devices that run a production-signed networkstack won\u0027t have a matching key in CTS.\n\nAlso non-mainline devices are free to sign networkstack with any key, so there is no single networkstack key that CTS could be signed with.",
